hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5712","Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ne ibne-Juraij se riwayat ki kaha : hamein Ata ne Ubaid-bin-Umair se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se teen martaba ijazat talab ki to jaisey unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko mashghool samjha aur wapas ho gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : kya ham ne Abdullah-bin-Qais ( abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) ki awaz nahi suni thi? unko andar aaney ki ijazat do, (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) wapas chaley gaey huey they, doosrey din) Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya gaya Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tum ne aisa kyon kiya? unhon-ne kaha : hamein yahi ( karne ka ( hukm diya jata tha. unhon-ne kaha : tum is par gawahi dilao , nahi to main (wo ( karunga (jo karunga ( wo (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) nikley Ansar ki majlis mein aaey unhon-ne kaha : is baat par tumharey haq main aur koi nahi, ham mein se jo sabse chhota hai wahi gawahi dega. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke samney ( khadey ho kar kaha : hamein ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak mein) usi ka hukm diya jata tha. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye hukm mujh se ojhal reh gaya, bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya."
"5713","Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ne ibne-Juraij se riwayat ki kaha : hamein Ata ne Ubaid-bin-Umair se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se teen martaba ijazat talab ki to jaisey unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko mashghool samjha aur wapas ho gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : kya ham ne Abdullah-bin-Qais ( abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) ki awaz nahi suni thi? unko andar aaney ki ijazat do, (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) wapas chaley gaey huey they, doosrey din) Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya gaya Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tum ne aisa kyon kiya? unhon-ne kaha : hamein yahi ( karne ka ( hukm diya jata tha. unhon-ne kaha : tum is par gawahi dilao , nahi to main (wo ( karunga (jo karunga ( wo (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu)) nikley Ansar ki majlis mein aaey unhon-ne kaha : is baat par tumharey haq main aur koi nahi, ham mein se jo sabse chhota hai wahi gawahi dega. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke samney ( khadey ho kar kaha : hamein ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak mein) usi ka hukm diya jata tha. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye hukm mujh se ojhal reh gaya, bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya."
"5714","abu-Aasim aur Nazar-bin-Shumail donon ne kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki. aur nazar ki hadis mein unhon-ne bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"5715","abu-Aasim aur Nazar-bin-Shumail donon ne kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki. aur nazar ki hadis mein unhon-ne bazaron mein hone-waale sodon ne mujhey us se mashghool kar diya ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"5716","Fazal bin-Musa ne kaha : hamein Talha bin Yahya ne abu-Burda se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : Assalaamualaikum , Abdullah-bin-Qais ( hazir hua) hai, unhon-ne aaney ki ijazat na di. unhon-ne phir kaha : Assalaamualaikum , ye abu-Musa hai, Assalaamualaikum , ye Ash-ari hai, iske baad chaley gaey, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unko mere paas wapas laao. mere paas wapas laao. wo aaey to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : abu-Musa ! aapko kis baat ne lota diya ? ham kaam mein mashghool they. unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : ijazat teen baar talab ki jaey, agar tum ko ijazat de di jaey (to aa jaao) warna lot jao. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya to aap is par gawah laaengey ya phir main ye karunga to Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) chaley gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha abu-Musa ko gawah mil gaya to Sham ko wo tumhen member ke paas milengey aur agar unko gawah nahi mila to wo tumhen nahi milengey, jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Sham ko aaey to unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko maujood paya , unhon-ne kaha abu-Musa ! kya kehtey hain? aapko gawah mil gaya? unhon-ne kaha : haan! Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) hain unhon (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : wo qaabile-bharosa gawah hain. (phir abu Tufail Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh ho kar) kaha : abu Tufail! ye (Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) kya kehtey hain? unhon (Hazrat Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ibne-khattaab ! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap yahi farma rahe they. lihaza aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) par azab na banein. unhon-ne kaha : Subhan-Allah! maine aik cheez suni aur chaha ke uska saboot hasil karun."
"5717","Fazal bin-Musa ne kaha : hamein Talha bin Yahya ne abu-Burda se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : Assalaamualaikum , Abdullah-bin-Qais ( hazir hua) hai, unhon-ne aaney ki ijazat na di. unhon-ne phir kaha : Assalaamualaikum , ye abu-Musa hai, Assalaamualaikum , ye Ash-ari hai, iske baad chaley gaey, Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unko mere paas wapas laao. mere paas wapas laao. wo aaey to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : abu-Musa ! aapko kis baat ne lota diya ? ham kaam mein mashghool they. unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : ijazat teen baar talab ki jaey, agar tum ko ijazat de di jaey (to aa jaao) warna lot jao. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya to aap is par gawah laaengey ya phir main ye karunga to Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) chaley gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha abu-Musa ko gawah mil gaya to Sham ko wo tumhen member ke paas milengey aur agar unko gawah nahi mila to wo tumhen nahi milengey, jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) Sham ko aaey to unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko maujood paya , unhon-ne kaha abu-Musa ! kya kehtey hain? aapko gawah mil gaya? unhon-ne kaha : haan! Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) hain unhon (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : wo qaabile-bharosa gawah hain. (phir abu Tufail Aamir bin Wasila (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh ho kar) kaha : abu Tufail! ye (Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) kya kehtey hain? unhon (Hazrat Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ibne-khattaab ! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap yahi farma rahe they. lihaza aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) par azab na banein. unhon-ne kaha : Subhan-Allah! maine aik cheez suni aur chaha ke uska saboot hasil karun."
"5718","Ali-bin Hashim ne Talha bin Yahya se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : to unhon (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : abu munzir ! ( Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ki kunniyat ( kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis suni thi? unhon-ne kaha : haan, ibne-khattaab! to aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ke liye azab na banein aur unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka qaul : Subhan-Allah aur uske baad ka hissa zikr nahi kya."
"5719","Ali-bin Hashim ne Talha bin Yahya se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne kaha : to unhon (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : abu munzir ! ( Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ki kunniyat ( kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis suni thi? unhon-ne kaha : haan, ibne-khattaab! to aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ke liye azab na banein aur unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka qaul : Subhan-Allah aur uske baad ka hissa zikr nahi kya."
"5720","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Shoba se unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur awaz di Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kon hai? maine kaha : main. aap bahar tashrif laey aur aap farma rahe they َ mein, main ( kaisa jawab hai? ("
"5721","Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Shoba se unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur awaz di Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kon hai? maine kaha : main. aap bahar tashrif laey aur aap farma rahe they َ mein, main ( kaisa jawab hai? ("
"5722","Wakee ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan ijazat talab ki, aap ne farmaya : ye kon hai? maine kaha : main. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mein, main ! (se kya pata chal sakta hai? ("
"5723","Wakee ne Shoba se, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan ijazat talab ki, aap ne farmaya : ye kon hai? maine kaha : main. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mein, main ! (se kya pata chal sakta hai? ("
"5724","Nazar-bin-Shumail abu-Aamir aqadi Wahab bin Jarir aur Bahaz, sab ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, un sab ki hadis mein (ye jumla bhi) hai : jaisey aap ne usko na-pasand farmaya ho."
"5725","Nazar-bin-Shumail abu-Aamir aqadi Wahab bin Jarir aur Bahaz, sab ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, un sab ki hadis mein (ye jumla bhi) hai : jaisey aap ne usko na-pasand farmaya ho."
"5726","Leis ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey ki jhiri mein andar jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas (lakdi ya lohe ka lambi lambi kai nokon wala) baal durust karne ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar khujaa rahe they, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey yaqeeni taur par pata chal jata ke tum mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein ghusa deta, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ki wjah se to rakha gaya hai. (ke aankh kisi ko khilwat ke aalim mein na dekh sakey.)"
"5727","Leis ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey ki jhiri mein andar jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas (lakdi ya lohe ka lambi lambi kai nokon wala) baal durust karne ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar khujaa rahe they, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey yaqeeni taur par pata chal jata ke tum mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein ghusa deta, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ki wjah se to rakha gaya hai. (ke aankh kisi ko khilwat ke aalim mein na dekh sakey.)"
"5728","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Sahal-bin-Sad Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey mein bin janey wali jhiri mein se jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baal durust karne wala lohey ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar ke baalon ko sanwaar rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : agar main jaan leta ke tum waqei mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein chubho deta. Allah ne ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ke liye to rakha hai."
"5729","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki ke Sahal-bin-Sad Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darwazey mein bin janey wali jhiri mein se jhanka, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baal durust karne wala lohey ka aik aala tha jis se aap sar ke baalon ko sanwaar rahe they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : agar main jaan leta ke tum waqei mujhey dekh rahe ho to main usko tumhari aankhon mein chubho deta. Allah ne ijazat leney ka tariqa aankh hi ke liye to rakha hai."
"5730","Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Leis aur Yunus ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5731","Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Mamar donon ne Zohri se unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Leis aur Yunus ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"5732","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hujrey mein jhanka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chode phal ka aik teer ya kai teer lekar uthey jaisey main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun ke aap khamoshi se uski aankhon mein wo teer chubhone ke imkan ka jaaiza ley rahe they."
"5733","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hujrey mein jhanka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chode phal ka aik teer ya kai teer lekar uthey jaisey main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun ke aap khamoshi se uski aankhon mein wo teer chubhone ke imkan ka jaaiza ley rahe they."
"5734","Suhel ke walid Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne ijazat ke baghair logon ke ghar mein taank jhank ki, unhein ijazat hai ke wo uski aankh phod din."
"5862","Rooh-bin-Ubada ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hisham-bin-Zaid se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo hadis bayan kar rahe they ke aik Yahudi aurat ne gosht mein zahar mila diya aur phir us ( gosht ( ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley aai , jis tarah Khalid (bin-Haaris) ki hadis hai."
"5863","Rooh-bin-Ubada ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hisham-bin-Zaid se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo hadis bayan kar rahe they ke aik Yahudi aurat ne gosht mein zahar mila diya aur phir us ( gosht ( ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley aai , jis tarah Khalid (bin-Haaris) ki hadis hai."
"5864","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne abu-Zuhaa se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab ham mein se koi shakhs bimar hota to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us (ke mutaassira hissey) par apna dayan hath phertey, phir farmatey : takleef ko door kar de, aey tamam insanon ke paalne waley ! shifa de, tu hi shifa dene wala hai, teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa jo bimari ko (zarra barabar baqi) nahi chhodti. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar huey aur aap ke liye aaza ko harkat dena mushkil ho gaya to maine aap ka hath thaamaa taake jis tarah khud Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kiya kartey they, mein bhi isi tarah karun to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath mere hath se chhuda liya, phir farmaya : aey mere Allah ! mujhey bakhsh de aur mujhey rafeeq aalaa ki maiyat (sath) ata kar de. unhon-ne kaha : phir main dekhney lagi to aap wafaat farma chukey they."
"5865","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne abu-Zuhaa se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab ham mein se koi shakhs bimar hota to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us (ke mutaassira hissey) par apna dayan hath phertey, phir farmatey : takleef ko door kar de, aey tamam insanon ke paalne waley ! shifa de, tu hi shifa dene wala hai, teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa jo bimari ko (zarra barabar baqi) nahi chhodti. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar huey aur aap ke liye aaza ko harkat dena mushkil ho gaya to maine aap ka hath thaamaa taake jis tarah khud Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kiya kartey they, mein bhi isi tarah karun to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath mere hath se chhuda liya, phir farmaya : aey mere Allah ! mujhey bakhsh de aur mujhey rafeeq aalaa ki maiyat (sath) ata kar de. unhon-ne kaha : phir main dekhney lagi to aap wafaat farma chukey they."
"5866","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : hamein Hushaim ne khabar di, Abu-Bakar-bin-khallaad aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Muawiya ne hadis bayan ki, Bishr-bin-Khalid ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis sunai. ibne-Bashar ne kaha : hamein ibne-Adi ne hadis bayan ki, un donon ( Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur ibne-abi-Adi) ne Shoba se riwayat ki. (usi tarah) abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Abu-Bakar-bin-khallaad ne bhi hamein ye hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : hamein Yahya qattaan ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, un sab ne Jarir ki sanad ke sath Aamash se riwayat ki. Hushaim aur Shoba ki riwayat mein hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna hath us ( mutaassira hissey ( par phertey aur) Sufiyan ( Sory ki hadis mein hai : aap apna dayan hath is par phertey aur Aamash se Sufiyan aur unse Yahya ki riwayat ki hui hadis ke aakhir mein hai, kaha : maine Mansoor ko ye hadis sunai to unhon-ne usi ke mutabiq Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se Masruq aur unse Ibrahim ki riwayat ki hui hadis bayan ki."
"5867","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : hamein Hushaim ne khabar di, Abu-Bakar-bin-khallaad aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein abu-Muawiya ne hadis bayan ki, Bishr-bin-Khalid ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis sunai. ibne-Bashar ne kaha : hamein ibne-Adi ne hadis bayan ki, un donon ( Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur ibne-abi-Adi) ne Shoba se riwayat ki. (usi tarah) abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Abu-Bakar-bin-khallaad ne bhi hamein ye hadis bayan ki, donon ne kaha : hamein Yahya qattaan ne Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, un sab ne Jarir ki sanad ke sath Aamash se riwayat ki. Hushaim aur Shoba ki riwayat mein hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna hath us ( mutaassira hissey ( par phertey aur) Sufiyan ( Sory ki hadis mein hai : aap apna dayan hath is par phertey aur Aamash se Sufiyan aur unse Yahya ki riwayat ki hui hadis ke aakhir mein hai, kaha : maine Mansoor ko ye hadis sunai to unhon-ne usi ke mutabiq Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se Masruq aur unse Ibrahim ki riwayat ki hui hadis bayan ki."
"5868","abu-Awana ne Mansoor se, unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke bila shubah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi mareez ki iyaadat kartey they, to farmatey : takleef door kar de, aey sab logon ke paalne waley ! isko shifa ata kar, to shifa dene wala hai, teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa (de) jo (zarra barabar) bimari ko na chhodey."
"5869","abu-Awana ne Mansoor se, unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke bila shubah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi mareez ki iyaadat kartey they, to farmatey : takleef door kar de, aey sab logon ke paalne waley ! isko shifa ata kar, to shifa dene wala hai, teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa (de) jo (zarra barabar) bimari ko na chhodey."
"5870","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Jarir ne Mansoor se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-zuhaa se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi mareez ke paas tashrif latey to us ke liye dua farmatey huey kehtey : takleef door kar de, aey sab insanon ke paalne waley ! aur shifa ata kar, tu hi shifa dene wala hai, shifa ata kar, teri shifa ke siwa (kahin) koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa se jo bimari ko (baqi) na chhodey Abu-Bakar ( ibne-Abi-Sheba ( ki riwayat mein hai : aap uske liye dua farmatey aur kehtey : aur tu hi shifa dene wala hai."
